      "section": "information",
      "key": "lastrada_sch",
      "source": "라 스트라다 최심부",
      "source_sha256": "b0471e76f174d94aba78946b21be80b623786f13aca808acc495ffa833e61622"
    },
    {
      "disc": 1,
      "locale": "jpn",
      "id": "coalesced:fd030c6b8405a55a59ecb7e4681b41a632d6fa6e33476b07ecf2589473788abc",
      "document": "..\\MC2Game\\Localization\\JPN\\MC2Compose.jpn",
      "section": "Chapter11",
      "key": "Chapter11_27",
      "source": "だが、絶望に打ちひしがれようとも\\n闇の中に目を向けよ・・・\\n隆盛の魂が輝き、南天の星が爛々と燃えている",
      "source_sha256": "9049eca028941da3b3cf6dc4c0c99cc368ad82f33988cecf7203f40271fe6175"
    },
    {
      "disc": 1,
      "locale": "jpn",
      "id": "coalesced:05cc2df179bb21a92c28321f0e0b8c0164e2047e6512ec5e70f8f45c0f57616e",
      "document": "..\\MC2Game\\Localization\\JPN\\MC2Compose.jpn",
      "section": "Chapter12",
      "key": "Chapter12_37",
      "source": "「王者の試練」\\n・王の証を持たぬ者は、各部屋で試練を受け「王の証」を入手せよ\\n・四つの王の証が揃えば「王の霊廟」への道が開かれる",
      "source_sha256": "a2b9533c888e4a30a1b45751ba6b7e098c26d2b5afc77b0d86369810847dbafa"
    },
    {
      "disc": 1,
      "locale": "jpn",
      "id": "coalesced:9a4a1efd76550fc844f58c61e1a7b695353717b6af9cb5ea480ef868f02e8ea9",
      "document": "..\\MC2Game\\Localization\\JPN\\MC2CSMB.jpn",
      "section": "CSMB12_131",
      "key": "voc_csmb_12131_05",
      "source": "だが、持たぬ者は\\nこの場で「王の試練」を受け\\n王の証を得るが良い。",
      "source_sha256": "a9306ffd026d51acfdf1fbdf2846ea04e21ed51011c567eeb8cd28e51ac10b35"
    },
    {
      "disc": 1,
      "locale": "jpn",
      "id": "coalesced:4abea58ae8588cc2f2087f84c47cb9c1628633495b0e5ee7169e561710409d39",
      "document": "..\\MC2Game\\Localization\\JPN\\MC2CSMB.jpn",
      "section": "CSMB12_131",
      "key": "voc_csmb_12131_06",
      "source": "王の試練とは\\nこの王の間にある、四つの部屋を巡り\\n証を手に入れることだ。",
      "source_sha256": "3d7b4c99da2caaac867a9f84ba451e5680a23d3a04133d7929a0028f17634d59"
    },
    {
      "disc": 1,
      "locale": "jpn",
      "id": "coalesced:fea24c56f31117ad9f3d24907c1138f41b2da2424c909bd7cf68bd8ecd1e8016",
      "document": "..\\MC2Game\\Localization\\JPN\\MC2CSMB.jpn",
      "section": "CSMB12_131",
      "key": "voc_csmb_12131_07",
      "source": "四つの王の証を揃えたのち\\n今一度、この場に立つが良い。",
      "source_sha256": "6d6174a87b0394eabbad77167954e636db2d3567e84cdb6cde8f9a417944125f"
    },
    {
      "disc": 1,
      "locale": "jpn",
      "id": "coalesced:9b5f44106b53af994d4b418ec0cbbb154e509c23b2c645bb08539cf9be11e563",
      "document": "..\\MC2Game\\Localization\\JPN\\MC2CSMB.jpn",
      "section": "CSMB12_131",
      "key": "voc_csmb_12131_08",
      "source": "さすれば、王の御霊が現れ\\n「王の霊廟」、ラ・ストラダの中心に\\n誘うであろう。",
      "source_sha256": "8b708b07dfd9fdc09a6f8075aa8e2257dd3f76d493170964d6a1e3c6685c2e71"
    },
    {
      "disc": 1,
      "locale": "jpn",
      "id": "coalesced:c2d74c74761c64212841f973a3ee2d9c1612e4f54e608c1cea722cd1e34813b7",
      "document": "..\\MC2Game\\Localization\\JPN\\MC2CSMB.jpn",
      "section": "CSMB12_131",
      "key": "voc_csmb_12131_09",
      "source": "ゼフィはすでに四つ持っている。\\nすぐに王の霊廟に行けるな。",
      "source_sha256": "ee31d5e525151f277d3c928f198efbbc68690320c181e866d3f2d4593216d3af"
    },
    {
      "disc": 1,
      "locale": "jpn",
      "id": "coalesced:9dddd06d81db0bae6b712120e5fae1a4015cf13f605036db4f42855f6080e06d",
      "document": "..\\MC2Game\\Localization\\JPN\\MC2CSMB.jpn",
      "section": "CSMB12_131",
      "key": "voc_csmb_12131_13",
      "source": "ふむ。王の証を全て手に入れれば\\n最後の戦いか。",
      "source_sha256": "6a23fdc25558d2ae9e60d8b3bac52128a14886f44ac9d2dd717831c18bf0a1ae"
    },
    {
      "disc": 1,
      "locale": "jpn",
      "id": "coalesced:3fb9c365ea874ed33f56fa8e5748b0eafac2c70cb4edc1e5b13e8bfbabd0d72e",
      "document": "..\\MC2Game\\Localization\\JPN\\MC2CSMB.jpn",
      "section": "CSMB12_131",
      "key": "voc_csmb_12131_14",
      "source": "そうね、王の霊廟には\\nシュエンザイトがいるはずだわ。",
      "source_sha256": "2dc33e573fc557f7eb5e53934102f9a1d6cef3bdc452fd8e10b117441a8a118c"
    },
